  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb, no spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Two related meanings: \"to send\" (*mandar un mensaje/paquete*) and \"to order/command\" (*mandar que + subjuntivo*, e.g. *te mando que te calles*)",
    "Common usage: *mandar un correo* (to send an email), *mandar saludos* (to send regards), *¿mande?* (Mexican Spanish, polite \"what did you say?\"/\"pardon?\")",
    "Related noun: **el mandato** (command/mandate), **el mandón/la mandona** (bossy person)"
  ],
